    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee4757991c30ebbaec31a58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有一个关于某位赛马娘的寓言故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8855334fc0da73b732918cf775e5146751a57e53ed3846afbf60394478114937",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9c7fd9bb456445b31897fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据说那名赛马娘拥有近乎究极的速度，\n并且和曼城茶座长得十分相似。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a086b4f5cb52e79274fdbaa6fa5d1b01a30eba55a1f1ce2e953de4e225c6171c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f723abe46b689a1c5331dfb1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许曼城茶座她……\n一直都在一场梦里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7c96d408c476c83476c1062d7b25817c1b05600b80878f44ecbf10ff96edf2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e496385fd9df85e2dc410d32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那位究极的赛马娘出现在眼前，\n并期望着“成为我，并超越我”。\n──这样的一场梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c78a173a1b580f805d86b7584cfcefa9f0e4f2e976be89f54e4a53e4cd3262",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3ccd2dc1cabb07d3ee1c4c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们在彼此的竞争下都获得了成长，\n一次次刷新双方的纪录，并且──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e7860cc053e6eb982e907b878ad6e52571a9fc4d823cd4c329e685719657e1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11f57d74ea8817cd6d73fb94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在不知不觉间……\n受到许多赛马娘的仰慕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b979d296becfba50b0040cd4bd57c5aca85a85db31fca8208eb247a6ff660dd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
